EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

As you are aware, we have issued a legal demand on the account due to non-payment. We have been attempting to come to a resolution regarding your account. If payments do not resume the account will be reported to business credit as a defaulted account and the file will be sent to our litigation team for review.

To help avoid that outcome, we would like to offer you some options to lower the payments and extend out the repayment period.

Please contact us as soon as possible so we can work together to resolve the delinquency on the account.  We look forward to hearing from you.

Thank you,

{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}




